<article class="content-panel content post-detail">
  <p class="post-date">June 25, 2026</p>
  <p>Edgerton House and Graduate Resident Life hosted a flower pressing workshop from 11 AM to 1 PM. Residents used fresh flowers to make their own pressed-flower pieces, with supplies available and the option to bring favorite blooms from home.</p>
  <p>The warm weather made the courtyard a lovely place to slow down, make something by hand, and spend time with neighbors.</p>
